'''Catamin Stages''' are a type of stage added in [[Version 7.1 Update|version 7.1]]. The Catamin Stages include various XP, [[Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]] and [[Catfruit]] farming stages like [[Steel Visage (Deadly)|Facing Danger]], except they cost [[Catamin]]s to play instead of [[Cat Energy|energy]] and can only be cleared a limited number of times each day. They can be accessed from the [[Legend Stages]] menu by pressing the "On Now +" button above the list of Special Stages. Once the event comes back, the rewards and play times will be reset. Note that some of the rarer or more advanced events such as [[Forged to Kill (Deadly)|Cybear's Vengeance]] and [[Growing Strange]] do not appear here.

Because Catamin Stages are considered separate maps from the originals, progress is tracked separately for each, and thus each one has its own [[Cat Food]] and [[Cat Energy|Leadership]] reward. Although they are considered separate maps, completing a Catamin Stage that has a Revenge Stage (such as an Advent or Cyclone Stage) will unlock the respective Revenge Stage as a normal Event Stage.

Starting from [[Version 9.8 Update|version 9.8]], playing certain [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed]], [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone]] and [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent]] stages will unlock them as Catamin Stages. Although there is little incentive to replay them if the player has already collected the rewards (other than the extra Cat Food and Leadership), if the player has played the stage but hasn't beaten it, they can beat it for the first time here, and claim the rewards while the stage isn't available normally.

'''Note:''' If you had already completed any of the Crazed, Cyclone and Advent stages listed below before they were added to Catamin Stages, they will not immediately be playable using Catamins. To make them appear as Catamin Stages, you can simply replay that completed stage when it appears and exit before 10 seconds as to not use up Energy.

