==Trivia==
*The Catamin Stages were originally only playable from 0:00 to 8:00. Starting from June 10th, 2019, they were available for 24 hours on Mondays, and later they were changed to appear 24/7.
*You can enter a stage and exit before 10 seconds to not use energy or battle items, but still get the stage as a Catamin stage
